" Russian layout command mappings for VSCodeVim.
" langmap stays disabled: https://github.com/VSCodeVim/Vim/issues/9432
" Literal arguments of r/f/t and inserted text keep the typed character.

" Shared by Normal, Visual and Operator-pending modes.
noremap ё `
noremap й q
noremap ц w
noremap у e
noremap к r
noremap е t
noremap н y
noremap г u
noremap щ o
